WEBVTT

00:00:02.046 --> 00:00:05.846
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.284 --> 00:00:10.118
Todoke Message

00:00:10.521 --> 00:00:19.452
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:20.732
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.732 --> 00:00:28.773
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.773 --> 00:00:29.102
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.307 --> 00:00:36.509
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.881 --> 00:00:41.011
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:45.112
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:49.519
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.694 --> 00:00:53.095
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.431 --> 00:00:57.424
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.735 --> 00:01:01.501
Todoke Message

00:01:01.906 --> 00:01:10.075
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.515 --> 00:01:14.451
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.852 --> 00:01:18.652
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.123 --> 00:01:28.555
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:31.035 --> 00:01:33.526
Due to the Hong Clan
ceasing all their work...

00:01:33.604 --> 00:01:36.198
...half the town's activities
have come to a halt!

00:01:36.574 --> 00:01:39.839
Even for the Hong Clan, there are some
things that are simply not acceptable!

00:01:39.911 --> 00:01:42.436
What exactly caused all of this
in the first place, Your Majesty?!

00:01:42.647 --> 00:01:45.343
I think the cause is quite obvious.

00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:46.815
As you all know...

00:01:46.884 --> 00:01:49.352
...Senior Secretary Hong of the
Department of Civil Affairs was arrested.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.115
That's because Secretary Hong...

00:01:51.189 --> 00:01:53.680
...is suspected of interfering with
Initiate Shurei Hong's National Ex...

00:01:53.758 --> 00:01:57.285
The Hong Clan is a proud family of the
highest nobility equal to the Ran Clan.

00:01:57.361 --> 00:02:00.228
If you arrest the leader of their clan
unjustly and without evidence...

00:02:00.298 --> 00:02:02.266
...it will naturally enrage
any prideful clan...

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.665
...not to mention
Senior Secretary Hong himself.

00:02:06.737 --> 00:02:09.228
Secretary Hong is the
leader of the Hong Clan?

00:02:09.507 --> 00:02:11.134
The leader of one of the
seven noble families...

00:02:11.209 --> 00:02:13.541
...has been working
for the central administration?

00:02:14.612 --> 00:02:18.207
There are surprisingly many senior
officials who didn't know about this.

00:02:18.282 --> 00:02:22.616
It was about fourteen, fifteen years ago
that he took over the clan.

00:02:23.387 --> 00:02:26.356
That man is the
leader of the Hong Clan?

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.826
- Where's Shurei?
- Seiran's with her.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.333
Don't worry.

00:02:37.401 --> 00:02:42.361
Hiding One's Head But Not One's Bottom

00:02:46.611 --> 00:02:48.078
My Lady.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:51.007
Before we go out... here.

00:02:53.885 --> 00:02:57.321
Miss Kocho asked me
to bring it from the residence.

00:02:57.822 --> 00:02:59.255
She had to go elsewhere...

00:02:59.323 --> 00:03:01.883
...and apologized for
not being able to see you off.

00:03:04.729 --> 00:03:07.391
Miss Kocho gave this to me
a while back.

00:03:20.444 --> 00:03:22.912
Makeup is a woman's war paint.

00:03:23.214 --> 00:03:26.547
Make sure you wear it
whenever you head into battle.

00:03:27.151 --> 00:03:29.813
That way, you definitely cannot cry.

00:03:30.454 --> 00:03:32.820
Because if you cry,
your makeup will run.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.653
And no matter
how little you applied...

00:03:34.725 --> 00:03:36.693
...your face will end up
looking disgraceful.

00:03:36.761 --> 00:03:38.558
That's why, no matter
how difficult things get...

00:03:38.629 --> 00:03:40.597
...you'll keep yourself from crying.

00:03:41.599 --> 00:03:44.363
Although Miss Kocho was thoughtful
enough to give this to me...

00:03:44.435 --> 00:03:46.903
...I couldn't bring myself
to wear makeup.

00:03:47.171 --> 00:03:52.370
I thought that it wasn't necessary in
a male-dominated world of politics.

00:03:53.044 --> 00:03:54.477
My Lady.

00:03:54.545 --> 00:03:55.978
I was wrong.

00:03:56.047 --> 00:03:59.505
Whether I wear makeup or not,
it's not going to change who I am.

00:04:00.117 --> 00:04:03.883
In the first place, it's not possible
for me to be the same as a man...

00:04:03.955 --> 00:04:06.185
...and I have no intention
of becoming one, anyway.

00:04:07.024 --> 00:04:08.491
Miss Kocho.

00:04:12.129 --> 00:04:13.756
I'm gonna wear makeup today.

00:04:13.831 --> 00:04:16.959
You told me I could come to you,
Seiran, if I wanted to cry...

00:04:17.034 --> 00:04:18.558
...but I'm not going to.

00:04:18.903 --> 00:04:20.495
Very well.

00:04:20.571 --> 00:04:25.440
In that case, I'll support you
so that you won't need to cry.

00:04:25.743 --> 00:04:30.646
Why is it always so easy for you
to know the words I want to hear?

00:04:33.751 --> 00:04:36.276
Now, we should get going shortly.

00:04:37.188 --> 00:04:39.088
The suspicion is that
Senior Secretary Hong...

00:04:39.156 --> 00:04:40.987
...inappropriately doctored
the results...

00:04:41.058 --> 00:04:44.721
...of the National Exams taken by Shinshi
Hong, who he sponsored, is it not?

00:04:44.795 --> 00:04:47.389
Secretary Sai...
of the Department of Protocol.

00:04:48.499 --> 00:04:50.330
I understand you were
completely against...

00:04:50.401 --> 00:04:52.767
...women being permitted to take the
National Exams, right from the beginning.

00:04:52.837 --> 00:04:56.102
Most people were against it!

00:04:56.173 --> 00:05:00.507
For one thing, from that perspective,
Official Ro would be far more suspicious!

00:05:00.578 --> 00:05:03.012
He's been treating
Initiate Hong very harshly.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.310
And I'm sure he's also got some
grudge against Secretary Hong.

00:05:05.383 --> 00:05:08.819
Official Ro was never
against women officials.

00:05:09.353 --> 00:05:11.589
Besides, not only does he not
bear a grudge...

00:05:11.589 --> 00:05:13.056
...against Secretary Hong,
interestingly...

00:05:13.124 --> 00:05:15.217
...he's a favorite of the Senior Secretary.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.921
Moreover, you knew
your subordinates were...

00:05:17.995 --> 00:05:20.361
...treating some
of the Initiates unfairly.

00:05:20.631 --> 00:05:22.622
Yet you did nothing to stop them?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.897
But I've heard that this
sort of thing always happens.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.234
Right. It always happens...

00:05:28.305 --> 00:05:30.830
...that Official Ro pays special
attention to those with the potential...

00:05:30.908 --> 00:05:32.739
...to become very accomplished
future officials.

00:05:38.749 --> 00:05:42.708
You showed absolutely no mercy,
even towards me.

00:05:42.787 --> 00:05:45.153
You completely humbled me.

00:05:45.222 --> 00:05:48.419
I doubt your pride is so fragile
that you could be humbled.

00:05:48.492 --> 00:05:51.723
But rather, Secretary Hong, how
long do you plan on staying here?

00:05:52.129 --> 00:05:54.290
Official Ro, please,
have some tea.

00:05:54.965 --> 00:05:57.092
Please hurry and
make your way to court.

00:05:57.168 --> 00:06:00.296
I came because you said
you would go if I went with you.

00:06:00.371 --> 00:06:02.669
Do you know how bad things are
both in and outside the palace?

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.708
I don't really care.

00:06:05.209 --> 00:06:08.303
For starters, that young
whelp who sits on the throne...

00:06:08.379 --> 00:06:11.746
...needs to learn more
about life's hardships.

00:06:12.216 --> 00:06:16.084
I imagine you're the last person
he wants to hear that from.

00:06:16.153 --> 00:06:17.814
Please, have a seat.

00:06:17.888 --> 00:06:21.324
After all, I seldom get the chance to
spend time with you in this manner.

00:06:21.659 --> 00:06:24.685
Have some tea.
It hasn't been poisoned.

00:06:30.701 --> 00:06:34.728
In fact, I did seriously contemplate
eliminating you a number of times...

00:06:34.805 --> 00:06:37.774
...after you'd ordered me
to work in the stables.

00:06:38.142 --> 00:06:39.734
I'm not surprised.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.870
I remember sensing danger
to my life many times then, as well.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:47.344
I'm glad I didn't. Your true intentions
became apparent afterwards.

00:06:48.185 --> 00:06:51.712
Eigetsu To is very young
and has no backing.

00:06:52.123 --> 00:06:54.387
Shurei's not only young
but also female.

00:06:54.458 --> 00:06:56.653
It was clear from the start that
both would be looked down upon...

00:06:56.727 --> 00:06:59.127
...and that people would make
moves to try and crush them.

00:06:59.463 --> 00:07:02.591
Your strict guidance builds
confidence in oneself...

00:07:02.666 --> 00:07:05.533
...and resistance to
the influence of the Courts.

00:07:06.237 --> 00:07:09.229
Then, by showing just
how capable the Shinshi are...

00:07:09.306 --> 00:07:11.570
...you make sure they're
no longer looked down upon.

00:07:11.642 --> 00:07:14.372
Menial jobs like cleaning
lavatories and polishing shoes...

00:07:14.445 --> 00:07:17.937
...are ideal for observing what
officials are truly like.

00:07:19.517 --> 00:07:23.476
The most senior court officials
decide how capable the Initiates are...

00:07:23.854 --> 00:07:26.687
...based on how much work
you've been giving them.

00:07:26.757 --> 00:07:29.282
- You're giving me too much credit.
- Not at all.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.225
All you need to do is
talk to Kijin or me...

00:07:31.295 --> 00:07:33.422
...and we'll promote you
to whatever position you desire.

00:07:33.497 --> 00:07:35.965
I'm satisfied with
my current situation.

00:07:36.033 --> 00:07:38.934
The previous king himself
bowed his head to me...

00:07:39.203 --> 00:07:42.798
...saying that someone like me
was necessary for the court.

00:07:42.873 --> 00:07:44.807
And now, once again.

00:07:44.875 --> 00:07:49.335
His son said he would
leave everything to me.

00:07:50.214 --> 00:07:53.115
This year is one with
high hopes for the future.

00:07:53.184 --> 00:07:56.676
The young Initiates understand
the spirit of helping one another.

00:07:57.087 --> 00:08:00.147
From now on, with their
support in the Royal Court...

00:08:00.324 --> 00:08:04.021
...the current king's rule
will surely be secure.

00:08:04.094 --> 00:08:06.927
He's been very fortunate,
right from the beginning.

00:08:08.299 --> 00:08:12.201
He's very fortunate because
he has someone like you here.

00:08:12.603 --> 00:08:16.972
I practically flipped when I learned that
the one secretly bringing them stuff...

00:08:17.575 --> 00:08:20.408
...like sweets, meat buns
and tea every day was you.

00:08:20.477 --> 00:08:23.537
It appears that practice
hasn't changed, even now.

00:08:23.881 --> 00:08:26.907
I remember you being
in quite the snit, saying...

00:08:26.984 --> 00:08:29.145
..."What is this pathetic
sweet bean bun?"

00:08:29.286 --> 00:08:31.049
But I ate it.

00:08:31.689 --> 00:08:33.850
You never say anything.

00:08:34.325 --> 00:08:35.519
From my point of view...

00:08:35.593 --> 00:08:37.788
...your life is one of always
getting the short end of the stick.

00:08:37.861 --> 00:08:39.726
Kindly leave me alone.

00:08:39.797 --> 00:08:43.494
His Majesty intends to reward you
for your many years of service.

00:08:45.302 --> 00:08:48.897
From now on, you'll always
attend court with me, won't you?

00:08:48.973 --> 00:08:52.136
I-I'm quite satisfied
with my current position!

00:08:52.209 --> 00:08:55.076
If you don't go,
then I too will not attend.

00:08:55.346 --> 00:08:56.870
Knowing you,
if it resulted in all work...

00:08:56.947 --> 00:08:59.245
...outside the castle walls
coming to a halt...

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.610
...it would bother
your conscience like hell.

00:09:02.686 --> 00:09:05.382
A-Are you threatening me?!

00:09:05.456 --> 00:09:07.390
Are you that set against it?

00:09:08.192 --> 00:09:10.592
Certainly, you'd be wasted
on His Majesty.

00:09:11.228 --> 00:09:14.823
Ah, that's it! Won't you come be
a steward for my household, then?!

00:09:14.898 --> 00:09:16.763
That's it.
That would be great.

00:09:18.035 --> 00:09:20.128
I'll attend court with you.

00:09:20.204 --> 00:09:23.105
I see.
That's too bad.

00:09:25.542 --> 00:09:28.943
In that case, as promised,
let us be off.

00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:34.247
Just as Ryuki said.

00:09:34.318 --> 00:09:36.946
It doesn't look like they're gonna
let me go easily, does it?

00:09:37.254 --> 00:09:38.346
Are you all right?

00:09:38.422 --> 00:09:41.823
They're sorely mistaken
if they think this will stop me!

00:09:44.495 --> 00:09:46.690
Now then,
on a different subject...!

00:09:47.731 --> 00:09:49.631
Senior Secretary Kou.

00:09:50.367 --> 00:09:52.392
For the past few years,
the Department of Protocol...

00:09:52.469 --> 00:09:55.029
...has continued to request
an increase to their budget.

00:09:55.472 --> 00:09:58.908
However, I couldn't imagine the need
for that department to spend so much.

00:09:59.176 --> 00:10:03.545
Further to a complete audit, we've found,
rather than unnecessary expenditures...

00:10:03.614 --> 00:10:07.550
...an excessive number of odd
items are being purchased.

00:10:07.951 --> 00:10:10.613
And every year, as a service to those
who passed the National Exams...

00:10:10.688 --> 00:10:12.781
...the Department of Protocol has
dispatched couriers free of charge...

00:10:12.856 --> 00:10:14.687
...to notify the hometowns
of the good news.

00:10:14.758 --> 00:10:16.419
Is there a problem with that?

00:10:16.493 --> 00:10:18.723
Yes. This year, for instance...

00:10:18.796 --> 00:10:22.232
...Eigetsu To sent his entire
stipend of eighty silver coins...

00:10:22.299 --> 00:10:25.393
...but not a single coin
arrived at his hometown.

00:10:25.836 --> 00:10:27.497
How do you explain that?

00:10:27.571 --> 00:10:28.936
A number of similar incidents...

00:10:29.006 --> 00:10:31.338
...have been reported
over the past several years.

00:10:33.577 --> 00:10:36.410
So this year, after the Department
of Protocol sent out its couriers...

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.243
...we had them
secretly followed.

00:10:38.315 --> 00:10:41.113
Now, whose residence do
you think they went to...

00:10:41.185 --> 00:10:43.847
...with those monies
still in their breast pockets?

00:10:44.054 --> 00:10:45.282
That's a lie!

00:10:45.356 --> 00:10:48.223
But I haven't mentioned
any names yet.

00:10:48.292 --> 00:10:52.126
In that case, I'll have my fair say
on matters as well, Secretary Kou!

00:10:52.396 --> 00:10:54.591
What is the meaning
of that mask you wear?

00:10:54.665 --> 00:10:59.227
How could a man who can't even show
his own face rise to the top ranks?

00:11:02.306 --> 00:11:04.968
You could in fact be
some unknown man...

00:11:05.042 --> 00:11:07.374
...wearing that mask pretending
to be the real Secretary Kou.

00:11:07.778 --> 00:11:09.747
If you have nothing to hide...

00:11:09.747 --> 00:11:12.409
...then take off that mask
immediately and show your face!

00:11:14.685 --> 00:11:17.813
This development is what you'd expect
from some second-rate fiction novel.

00:11:17.888 --> 00:11:21.051
Very well.
If you insist, then I'll take it off.

00:11:21.125 --> 00:11:24.788
No! Please don't!
I mustn't betray my wife anymore!

00:11:24.862 --> 00:11:29.060
Please! Don't disturb
my peaceful life any further!

00:11:29.333 --> 00:11:32.359
What's this?
Is his face that ugly?

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.929
Reishin says his face
is one that would...

00:11:35.005 --> 00:11:37.633
..."cause flying crows to fall
unconscious from the sky".

00:11:37.708 --> 00:11:41.906
It may be unconvincing coming from
me, but looks don't make the man.

00:11:44.314 --> 00:11:47.943
If he insists so strongly, then sure,
why not take that mask off?

00:11:48.185 --> 00:11:49.787
However, everyone must
turn their backs.

00:11:49.787 --> 00:11:53.279
You are only to show
Senior Secretary Sai.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:56.058
- Can I look too?!
- You mustn't!

00:11:58.095 --> 00:12:00.529
Those who don't know what
Secretary Kou's face looks like...

00:12:00.597 --> 00:12:03.327
...don't let curiosity get the better of you.
You'd be wise not to turn and look.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:06.995
If you look, at best, you won't be able
to do any proper work for three years...

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:09.470
...and if you're unlucky,
you'll lose your senses.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.805
That old fox... Now, then...!

00:12:20.584 --> 00:12:23.109
My Lady.
Let's take care of them already.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:26.116
Not here. We'd cause
trouble for everyone else.

00:12:29.026 --> 00:12:30.323
Miss Shurei!

00:12:42.639 --> 00:12:44.607
This will only take a moment.

00:12:45.042 --> 00:12:46.532
You gonna fight?!

00:12:58.622 --> 00:12:59.782
Let's hurry.

00:12:59.857 --> 00:13:01.085
Right.

00:13:07.598 --> 00:13:08.826
This way.

00:13:26.183 --> 00:13:28.242
Miss Shurei!

00:13:28.318 --> 00:13:29.512
Ryushin!

00:13:36.093 --> 00:13:37.993
Wh-What's with these guys?

00:13:38.061 --> 00:13:42.327
You have some nerve treating
our Lady Shurei like this!

00:13:43.133 --> 00:13:45.829
I'm really sorry about how we've
acted towards you lately, Shurei.

00:13:45.903 --> 00:13:48.371
But officials are really
important people, right?

00:13:48.438 --> 00:13:50.998
So if you hung around us,
we thought...

00:13:51.074 --> 00:13:54.271
...you'd be made fun of and end up
being shamed because of us.

00:13:59.383 --> 00:14:02.045
Hurry up and go!
You're in a hurry, aren't you?

00:14:02.352 --> 00:14:04.547
We'll take care of things here!

00:14:05.455 --> 00:14:07.218
- Let's go.
- Yes.

00:14:08.025 --> 00:14:09.993
Y-You're not going anywhere!

00:14:12.496 --> 00:14:15.465
Thank you, Ryushin! Everyone!

00:14:21.538 --> 00:14:22.971
Halt!

00:14:23.974 --> 00:14:26.636
This is not some place where people
like you are allowed to enter.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.802
Turn around and leave!

00:14:27.878 --> 00:14:30.847
But I'm an official Initiate!

00:14:30.914 --> 00:14:31.938
Don't know you.

00:14:32.015 --> 00:14:36.543
I have to be there by noon.
Please! Let me through!

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.487
My Lady.
Let's fight our way through.

00:14:43.393 --> 00:14:45.361
H-Hello, Initiate Heki!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.895
Hakumei.

00:14:47.965 --> 00:14:51.264
I figured something like this would
happen, so I came to meet you.

00:14:51.335 --> 00:14:53.895
I'm not like you,
from a noble but poor family.

00:14:53.971 --> 00:14:57.930
So lots of officials are soft on me.
I'll take you. Hurry.

00:14:58.208 --> 00:15:01.837
- Ah, thank you. Let's go, Seiran.
- Yes!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:12.010
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:15:19.396 --> 00:15:21.364
If you please,
Senior Secretary Kou.

00:15:45.155 --> 00:15:47.953
Are you satisfied now,
Secretary Sai?

00:15:52.229 --> 00:15:53.491
As expected.

00:15:53.563 --> 00:15:57.465
There's no way he'd be able to keep his
senses after seeing Hoju's utter beauty.

00:15:57.534 --> 00:16:00.332
Even for a person like
Senior Secretary Sai, I still pity him.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.198
You're the one who tried to...

00:16:05.275 --> 00:16:08.005
...entrap Initiate Hong
and Reishin Hong, aren't you?

00:16:09.146 --> 00:16:11.205
You embezzled public funds...

00:16:11.281 --> 00:16:14.148
...spent money recklessly
to bribe your way into promotions...

00:16:14.217 --> 00:16:18.017
...and even tried to blame your
wrongdoings on Official Ro, didn't you?

00:16:19.322 --> 00:16:21.290
We have our testimony now.

00:16:22.626 --> 00:16:24.719
Hoju. You're tricking him into it.

00:16:24.795 --> 00:16:26.353
It's all the truth.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:29.888
We also have testimony from the idiots
involved in that mud ball incident.

00:16:29.966 --> 00:16:31.194
This is no trick.

00:16:31.268 --> 00:16:34.863
Well, yes, but it feels
like you're tricking him into it.

00:16:36.406 --> 00:16:40.809
No. I think this should've been
done from the very beginning.

00:16:42.045 --> 00:16:45.572
Really, I didn't think
he was this much of a fool.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.754
S-Secretary Hong!

00:16:51.822 --> 00:16:55.758
Now then, you did something
exceptionally amusing.

00:16:55.826 --> 00:16:59.227
N-N-N-No, it wasn't my doing.

00:16:59.296 --> 00:17:01.598
Even if there is a one-in-a-million
chance that's true...

00:17:01.598 --> 00:17:03.623
...I believe it was your doing...

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.793
...so the truth of the matter
is of little importance.

00:17:05.869 --> 00:17:07.359
That's insane.

00:17:07.437 --> 00:17:09.735
From now on, it's probably in your best
interest not to go near any place...

00:17:09.806 --> 00:17:11.637
...that has connections
to the Hong Clan.

00:17:11.708 --> 00:17:14.006
I've already sent out a notice.
If you're found, you're finished.

00:17:14.077 --> 00:17:18.639
You'll be weighted down
and tossed into a nearby river.

00:17:18.715 --> 00:17:23.049
There isn't a single place in this country
that doesn't have ties to the Hong Clan.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.089
Like me, my clan is extremely
difficult to control when angered...

00:17:26.156 --> 00:17:28.954
...and is exceptionally vindictive.

00:17:29.259 --> 00:17:33.093
We won't forget your name or face
even after one hundred years.

00:17:34.564 --> 00:17:35.826
Scary.

00:17:35.899 --> 00:17:38.231
I-I'll never do this sort of...!

00:17:38.301 --> 00:17:40.269
Unfortunately for you,
it is my practice...

00:17:40.337 --> 00:17:43.067
...to crush those who I despise
until they can no longer stand.

00:17:43.306 --> 00:17:45.536
A few years ago you made
fun of my adopted son...

00:17:45.609 --> 00:17:47.133
...calling him an abandoned child.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.839
I've had absolutely no intention
of forgiving you since then.

00:17:52.516 --> 00:17:54.484
Oh, one other thing.

00:18:01.057 --> 00:18:03.116
That's where he was hiding it?

00:18:03.193 --> 00:18:06.424
There's an expression about hiding
one's head but not one's bottom...

00:18:06.496 --> 00:18:08.828
...but he couldn't even manage
to hide his head.

00:18:09.566 --> 00:18:13.263
The ring that symbolizes the
Sa Clan's leader. Or rather, a fake of it.

00:18:13.336 --> 00:18:14.598
Ah, that's...!

00:18:14.671 --> 00:18:17.936
I have no idea why you would
have this sort of thing...

00:18:18.341 --> 00:18:22.505
...but it's pointless to take this
to the Sa Clan and try to get help.

00:18:22.913 --> 00:18:25.643
- I've already taken care of matters.
- No way.

00:18:25.715 --> 00:18:29.481
Did you expect me to leave you
even a single escape route?

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:33.817
I-It's all because women...!

00:18:34.658 --> 00:18:37.718
It's all because women
came into the picture!

00:18:38.528 --> 00:18:41.088
- She's late.
- She'll be here for sure.

00:18:46.336 --> 00:18:48.930
You surpassed even me when
you passed the National Exams.

00:18:49.005 --> 00:18:50.233
Show those brainless officials...

00:18:50.307 --> 00:18:53.868
...who can only make fun of women
and children, what you're capable of.

00:18:53.944 --> 00:18:55.502
Hakumei.

00:18:57.214 --> 00:18:58.340
Again?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:02.043
Initiate Heki.
How are you at fighting?

00:19:02.118 --> 00:19:05.110
We of the Heki Clan excel
in the arts and literature.

00:19:05.522 --> 00:19:07.956
We haven't the slightest
knowledge about fighting.

00:19:08.024 --> 00:19:09.685
H-He's of no use.

00:19:13.363 --> 00:19:15.661
Can I fight while
protecting them both?

00:19:28.345 --> 00:19:29.505
Hey!

00:19:29.579 --> 00:19:30.876
Ensei!

00:19:31.081 --> 00:19:34.107
It's been a while,
hasn't it, Princess, Seiran?

00:19:38.154 --> 00:19:40.179
The ones who compiled
the papers...

00:19:40.257 --> 00:19:43.420
...documenting your misdeeds
are Initiate Hong and Initiate To.

00:19:43.493 --> 00:19:45.358
These detailed figures...!

00:19:46.062 --> 00:19:49.156
Initiate Hong, having been
falsely accused of wrongdoing...

00:19:49.232 --> 00:19:51.200
...stayed up all night to complete this...

00:19:51.268 --> 00:19:53.736
...and submit it in the hopes that
it would help vindicate her.

00:19:53.803 --> 00:19:55.737
The two were quite aware...

00:19:55.805 --> 00:19:58.330
...of who was engaging in inappropriate
activities, Senior Secretary Sai.

00:19:58.408 --> 00:20:01.172
D-Don't you think it strange?

00:20:01.244 --> 00:20:03.872
How the National Exams were
all of a sudden open to women?

00:20:03.947 --> 00:20:07.007
And then how conveniently that little
girl of seventeen passed as Tanka?

00:20:07.083 --> 00:20:09.210
The National Exams aren't so simple!

00:20:09.286 --> 00:20:11.447
The king and his close advisors
forced through the issue...

00:20:11.521 --> 00:20:14.251
...of women being allowed to take
the Exams. Don't you find it odd?

00:20:14.791 --> 00:20:19.558
Your Majesty, I also feel the
same way. Please, tell us the truth.

00:20:19.629 --> 00:20:21.893
If it's not by her own ability,
we cannot accept it.

00:20:21.965 --> 00:20:23.899
As I understand it,
that was the primary reason...

00:20:23.967 --> 00:20:26.367
...why the previous king introduced
the national exam system.

00:20:26.436 --> 00:20:28.836
- That's right!
- Your Majesty!

00:20:29.873 --> 00:20:33.570
You're right. Placing priority on ability is
the principle behind the National Exams.

00:20:33.843 --> 00:20:35.606
That's why the previous king...

00:20:35.679 --> 00:20:37.647
...created an exam system
where it was impossible...

00:20:37.714 --> 00:20:39.614
...for even the king to interfere.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.841
All of you who have gone
through the National Exams...

00:20:42.919 --> 00:20:45.547
...should know that more
than anyone, right?

00:20:45.622 --> 00:20:48.386
You've experienced it first hand...

00:20:48.458 --> 00:20:50.392
...just how strictly impartial
the National Exams are...

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.587
...and how effectively they
prevent any impropriety.

00:20:52.662 --> 00:20:54.721
Yes, the National Exams
are not easy.

00:20:55.565 --> 00:20:59.797
Then why does
Initiate Hong not show herself?

00:21:01.104 --> 00:21:03.163
I have doubts as to
whether or not...

00:21:03.239 --> 00:21:05.707
...it really was Initiate Hong
who wrote these papers.

00:21:07.677 --> 00:21:11.408
It's just about noon,
the time the inquiry is to start.

00:21:11.481 --> 00:21:13.608
Could it be that she knew
she would embarrass herself...

00:21:13.683 --> 00:21:15.742
...and so ran away instead?

00:21:17.587 --> 00:21:20.249
Well, even if she doesn't
become an official...

00:21:20.323 --> 00:21:21.620
...as a lady of the Hong Clan...

00:21:21.691 --> 00:21:24.489
...no doubt she will have
plenty of good marriage proposals.

00:21:38.241 --> 00:21:40.539
Shurei Hong, reporting for duty.

00:21:51.021 --> 00:21:54.320
Initiate Hong. There are those who
suspect there was impropriety involved...

00:21:54.391 --> 00:21:57.849
...in your passing the National Exams.
What do you wish to do?

00:21:58.528 --> 00:22:01.588
I cannot afford to quit
being an official...

00:22:01.664 --> 00:22:04.098
...for I have not yet
accomplished anything.

00:22:04.401 --> 00:22:08.497
It's noon. As of this moment, we will
hold the inquiry here, in this place.

00:22:09.272 --> 00:22:12.708
With a public oral examination,
there can be no means for impropriety.

00:22:14.244 --> 00:22:15.734
As you wish, please.

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:26.711
Very well, let the inquiry begin!

00:22:48.711 --> 00:22:53.410
Now, one final question, why did you,
as a woman, want to become an official?

00:22:53.883 --> 00:22:57.819
I'm afraid if the question is,
"why, as a woman"...

00:22:57.887 --> 00:23:00.082
...I have no answer for you.

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:03.591
I came to do what I myself can do.

00:23:03.893 --> 00:23:07.420
I would have taken the National
Exams whether I was man or woman.

00:23:07.497 --> 00:23:09.021
I want to be an official.

00:23:09.099 --> 00:23:11.067
I want to protect as much as
I can with these hands.

00:23:11.568 --> 00:23:13.536
Those were my thoughts.

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:16.331
That's why I took the National Exams.

00:23:24.747 --> 00:23:25.941
Shurei.

00:23:30.587 --> 00:23:35.684
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.892 --> 00:23:42.229
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.532 --> 00:23:47.492
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.704 --> 00:23:52.801
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.810 --> 00:23:58.213
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.749 --> 00:24:04.880
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.655 --> 00:24:16.224
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:22.697
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.106 --> 00:24:28.169
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.045 --> 00:24:34.608
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.984 --> 00:24:41.787
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:46.296 --> 00:24:47.764
Next Episode
